    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Namumweni Mwanta nemani kumbadi yakameŋa. Nindi, Etaku nyitu yayishimi kulonda yipamba yakuchisu yikanki; yikotweli hanyitu yawu wejima wawu; akushalaku nukuyijaha nampoku yakabali; hikwakatemuka niwumuku, hikwakapuluka niwumuku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.9.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hela akapunda nawu epili mukaluŋa, chikasa chami chakayinonamu; hela akakandama mwiwulu, nakayihulumunamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hela akabatama hewulu daKarameli, nakayikeŋakeŋa, nakayifumishaku; hela akabatama kumesu ami mwishina dakaluŋalwiji mwamweni, hela mwenomu nakamuleja kapela wakayisuma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hela akaya kumesu awayilumbu jawu muwukoli, nikwenoku nawa nakaleja mpoku yakabali yakayiŋaha, nakayita mesu ami kulonda niyikoŋi chatama, hichakuyikoŋa chachiwahuku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.9.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa Mwanta Yehova wamazaza, diyi welaŋa akunka iseki dinowa nikunowa, niantu ashakamamu ejima hiyakudishonashona; dakababa dejima neyi Kaloŋa; dakanyikumuka cheŋi neyi Kaloŋa kaEjipitu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Diyi watuŋaŋa mwiwulu matalindi ahewulu, diyi washimatisha ifumbafumba dindi heseki; diyi watambikaŋa meji amukaluŋalwiji hakuyiichila hewulu deseki; ijina dindi diyi Yehova.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.9.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova nindi, Enu anyana kaIsarela, kudami himudi neyi anyana kawaEtiyopiya ku? Hinayifumishili mwituŋa daEjipituku? Hinafumishili aFwilistinu kuKafwatoru ku? Hinafumishili aSiriya kuKiruku? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiyenu, mesu aMwanta Yehova atala hawantiwu wanshidi, nakawujilumuna wufumi hewulu deseki; hela chochu, hinakajilumuna chikupu mutaŋa waYakobaku. Dimu mwanahoshiyi Yehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋatala, nakaleja antu, nakasala akwamutaŋa waIsarela mukachi kanyuza yejima, neyi chasalaŋawu mbutu mumusalu, hela chochu, kalubutu kakuminamu kukeha hikakaholoka hesekuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akwanshidi ejima ahadi antu ami ahoshaŋa nawu, Kutama hikwakatuwana, hela kutuketulwila kumbiduku; akafwa kumpoku yakabali.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.9.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ifuku odu nakatuŋiulula cheŋi tabanaka yaDavidi yashiwuka, nakajika mwahumoka; nakatuŋulula cheŋi mbaŋu jayu jafwa, nakayituŋulula neyi chiyadiŋi hamafuku akumwaka; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akayiheta aEdomi anashaluku, ninyuza yejima yatumbawu ijina dami. Dimu mwanahoshiyi Yehova wudi nakwila chumichi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.9.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova nindi, Tiyenu, kwakenza mafuku akwila mukwakudima wakamuwana mukwakwaŋula, mukwakudatola nyikabu yavinyu wakamuwana mukwakukuwa mbutu; mapidi akavwa vinyu yatowala, mpidi janyanya jejima jakanowa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakafuntisha cheŋi antu ami aIsarela ayili muwukoli, akatuŋulula cheŋi nyikala yela dehi mahembi hohu, akashakamamu; akadima matempa anyivinyu, akanwamu vinyu yawu; akadima maha, akadyamu yakudya yawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakayitumba mwituŋa dawu, hiyamba kayibwita nawa chiŋa mwituŋa dawu dinayinkuku. Dimu mwanahoshiyi Yehova Nzambi yeyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.9.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
